<p>Champagne Flutes tend to give cocktails that classy look.</p>
<p>Typically reserved for Champagne or Prosecco-based drinks, they are a classy affair.</p>
<p>For example, can you imagine drinking a <a href="/cocktails/kir-royale/">Kir Royale</a> from a Pint Glass? Or a <a href="/cocktails/mimosa/">Mimosa</a> from a Highball Glass?</p>
<p>Nope!</p>
<p>Champagne cocktail = Champagne Flute – I’m pretty sure it’s the law.</p>
